# Public settings of the production build (the same values the website serves in its JS).
# Lets a local build (npm run build, ios:sync, android:sync) talk to the live Firebase project
# and oral-exam service. CI sets the same names from repository variables, which take precedence.
# Firebase web config is not a secret: access is controlled by database.rules.json.
